      "tag": "@stonecrop/nuxt_v0.16.5",
      "date": "Mon, 03 Aug 2026 11:12:57 GMT",
      "comments": {
        "patch": [
          {
            "comment": "Inline @stonecrop/desktop and @stonecrop/code-editor for SSR, fixing an 'Unknown file extension .css' crash under pnpm installs where a transitively-externalized parent hid atable's stylesheet. DocBuilder now locks introspected identity fields from the shared schema constant, and the playground no longer needs overrides.json."
          }
        ]
      }
